    description: ""  # a1b8
    fields:  # a1b8
      statement: "linkers/inherited_calls.py builds class_ids_by_name globally with no src_lang filter (build ~383-388; _resolve_site2 lookup ~574-663), so a Java receiver typed Property misbinds onto a same-named Scala trait, producing false cross-language ast_call_inherited_method edges at conf 0.70 (docspell). Gate Site-2 candidate lookup on src_lang. INV-nilud family."  # a1b8
      root_cause: "class_ids_by_name in linkers/inherited_calls.py is built across all languages with no src_lang partition, so Site-2 candidate lookup can match a class/trait of a different language that shares the receiver type name."  # a1b8
